    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out one more cool game</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/1d57cc5d8b441d381c6424a4026c2129.poster.avif?t=1719483602\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/1d57cc5d8b441d381c6424a4026c2129.webm?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/1d57cc5d8b441d381c6424a4026c2129.mp4?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Bike Messenger lets you hop right into a big city and ride through it on your bike. Deliver packages to clients, find your way through the dense traffic, and from time to time be the only one on the street observing an amazing sunrise!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/a13fcd895214c661446103963a3bb351.poster.avif?t=1719483602\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/a13fcd895214c661446103963a3bb351.webm?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/a13fcd895214c661446103963a3bb351.mp4?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Your main objective is to deliver various packages. Sometimes it's just food or regular items from shops. But beware! Some clients look shady and you can just imagine what\u2019s in the box. Will you take this job? Decide for yourself...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/8a24da071cceb4e45a6bfd5e949fa5f1.poster.avif?t=1719483602\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/8a24da071cceb4e45a6bfd5e949fa5f1.webm?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/8a24da071cceb4e45a6bfd5e949fa5f1.mp4?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game is all about finding the best route through the traffic. You can take a slow pace and admire the views but you will be rewarded for reaching a destination point as fast as possible.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/76582cb0365c1202d6ad5d9f1e634ffc.poster.avif?t=1719483602\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/76582cb0365c1202d6ad5d9f1e634ffc.webm?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/76582cb0365c1202d6ad5d9f1e634ffc.mp4?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Customize your bike as you want. Repair the old one, buy the most expensive new bike, or just go with the budget one. You can replace parts, change colors, and make the bike reflect your own personality.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1719483602\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/1d57cc5d8b441d381c6424a4026c2129.poster.avif?t=1719483602\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/1d57cc5d8b441d381c6424a4026c2129.webm?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/1d57cc5d8b441d381c6424a4026c2129.mp4?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Bike Messenger lets you hop right into a big city and ride through it on your bike. Deliver packages to clients, find your way through the dense traffic, and from time to time be the only one on the street observing an amazing sunrise!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/a13fcd895214c661446103963a3bb351.poster.avif?t=1719483602\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/a13fcd895214c661446103963a3bb351.webm?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/a13fcd895214c661446103963a3bb351.mp4?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Your main objective is to deliver various packages. Sometimes it's just food or regular items from shops. But beware! Some clients look shady and you can just imagine what\u2019s in the box. Will you take this job? Decide for yourself...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/8a24da071cceb4e45a6bfd5e949fa5f1.poster.avif?t=1719483602\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/8a24da071cceb4e45a6bfd5e949fa5f1.webm?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/8a24da071cceb4e45a6bfd5e949fa5f1.mp4?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game is all about finding the best route through the traffic. You can take a slow pace and admire the views but you will be rewarded for reaching a destination point as fast as possible.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/76582cb0365c1202d6ad5d9f1e634ffc.poster.avif?t=1719483602\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/76582cb0365c1202d6ad5d9f1e634ffc.webm?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/76582cb0365c1202d6ad5d9f1e634ffc.mp4?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Customize your bike as you want. Repair the old one, buy the most expensive new bike, or just go with the budget one. You can replace parts, change colors, and make the bike reflect your own personality.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1719483602\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477930/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1719483602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Be the fastest messenger on streets, hop across all the traffic. Observe an amazing sunrise while chilling out on your bike. Find the best route to deliver various packages, take part in killing-fast street races, customize your bike, and fly on your bike through the symphony of vibrant city sounds!",
